      <li><a href="https://www.cs.cornell.edu/courses/cs4780/2022sp/notes/LectureNotes20.html">Cornell CS4780: Decision Trees</a> and <a href="https://www.cs.cornell.edu/courses/cs4780/2022sp/notes/LectureNotes21.html">Bagging and Random Forests</a> — Short written routes through recursive grouping and averaging; compare their abstractions with our explicit threshold and probability conventions.</li>
